{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03589",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.88,
      "end_seconds": 2.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.43,
      "end_seconds": 8.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.65,
      "end_seconds": 13.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "I've been feeling like I have flu."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.35,
      "end_seconds": 18.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.04,
      "end_seconds": 20.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Nothing regular, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.68,
      "end_seconds": 41.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.66,
      "end_seconds": 46.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Yesterday, it came on out of nowhere."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.83,
      "end_seconds": 50.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Mm, okay. How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.4,
      "end_seconds": 54.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly. There's nausea as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.47,
      "end_seconds": 61.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Have you been feeling like you have flu at any time before this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.56,
      "end_seconds": 71.4,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "Right, yes, something like this happened last winter, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.08,
      "end_seconds": 94.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "So, and what about cough, sore throat, diarrhoea or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.23,
      "end_seconds": 100.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "No, um, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.07,
      "end_seconds": 105.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.46,
      "end_seconds": 109.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "So, no, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.7,
      "end_seconds": 113.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.76,
      "end_seconds": 119.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Yes, diclofenac. I get swelling of my lips."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.59,
      "end_seconds": 122.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.15,
      "end_seconds": 131.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.88,
      "end_seconds": 134.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.46,
      "end_seconds": 140.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.02,
      "end_seconds": 146.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "So, do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.84,
      "end_seconds": 152.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.48,
      "end_seconds": 155.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.68,
      "end_seconds": 167.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.87,
      "end_seconds": 203.89,
      "duration_seconds": 16.02,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 114 beats a minute, pressure 133 over 87, BMI works out to 26.6, weight 64 kilos, temperature is 36.7 degrees, respiratory rate 19, saturation 99 percent, height 155 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.91,
      "end_seconds": 208.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.41,
      "end_seconds": 216.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.83,
      "end_seconds": 255.05,
      "duration_seconds": 28.22,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at possible new type 1 diabetes starting to turn acidic or a viral illness. I think a finger-prick glucose and ketones makes sense here, for thirst and weight loss. This is not flu, your sugar is very high, and you need hospital insulin today. I'll also refer you to the diabetes team."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.09,
      "end_seconds": 261.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "I mean, can you send me for blood tests?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.92,
      "end_seconds": 280.46,
      "duration_seconds": 14.54,
      "text": "Okay, I don't think that's needed at this stage, the history doesn't call for it. I'd like you back straight away. Let me check I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.73,
      "end_seconds": 285.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "So, I come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.52,
      "end_seconds": 294.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.73,
      "end_seconds": 299.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Good, um, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.82,
      "end_seconds": 302.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}